{"words": [{"text": "وَلَمَّا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "جَآءَهُمْ", "translation": "came to them"}, {"text": "كِتَـٰبٌۭ", "translation": "a Book"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "عِندِ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مُصَدِّقٌۭ", "translation": "confirming"}, {"text": "لِّمَا", "translation": "what (was)"}, {"text": "مَعَهُمْ", "translation": "with them"}, {"text": "وَكَانُوا۟", "translation": "though they used to"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلُ", "translation": "before"}, {"text": "يَسْتَفْتِحُونَ", "translation": "(that), pray for victory"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "over"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translation": "disbelieved "}, {"text": "فَلَمَّا", "translation": "then when"}, {"text": "جَآءَهُم", "translation": "came to them"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "عَرَفُوا۟", "translation": "they recognized"}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translation": "they disbelieved"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ ۚ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "فَلَعْنَةُ", "translation": "So (the) curse"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "(is) on"}, {"text": "ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ", "translation": "the disbelievers"}], "sahih": "And when there came to them a Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] from Allāh confirming that which was with them - although before they used to pray for victory against those who disbelieved - but [then] when there came to them that which they recognized, they disbelieved in it; so the curse of Allāh will be upon the disbelievers."}